  <div class="about-page">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <p>
      <em>Bedroom Dialectics</em> is where I write down things I'm trying to understand.
    </p>

    <p>
      Most of it comes from paying attention to things that usually go unnoticed: the physical labor that keeps modern life running, the habits we repeat without thinking, and the strange gap between how we talk about the world and how it actually feels to live in it.
    </p>

    <p>
      Writing here is just a way to look at those tensions honestly, without pretending to have final answers or needing to turn everything into quick advice.
    </p>

    <h2>Colophon</h2>

    <p>
      Built with <a href="https://astro.build" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Astro</a>, static HTML/CSS, and set in <em>IBM Plex Mono</em>. No tracking, ads, or cookies.
    </p>

    <p>
      New essays are published via <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
